{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_006mak_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_006mak_1005_006mak", "source_sha256": "6e99108dad20d8af6ec5fb5006608c5f4a68ae957823f7051c6a36cfb2eef2ed", "ja": "見ててください、{$P$}！　女の子に\n戻りたくても戻れない切なさ、演じきってみせます！", "zh": "请等着看在下的表现吧，{$P$}！\n在下会完美诠释公主想变回女孩子却又做不到的煎熬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
